  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
    "Use Shadcn UI for dropdowns, sheets (cart drawer), dialogs, and toasts.",
    "Build the core layout using standard HTML+Tailwind for maximum flexibility, specifically the product grids and hero sections.",
    "Implement the 'hover-second-image' feature on the product cards by swapping the image src or toggling opacity on hover.",
    "Sticky header should have backdrop-blur and a clear CTA. Do not hide desktop menu in a hamburger.",
    "Ensure primary buttons use the accent color #FF3F6C.",
    "Typography: Apply Outfit for headings and Poppins for body text.",
    "Implement Razorpay checkout flow mock (button -> success toast)."
